  "prefLabel": "En 1204.02 Effect of Arrearages",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1204.02 Effect of Arrearages. Arrearages existing on customers’ bills prior to the winter period shall not make a customer eligible for disconnection during the winter unless the arrearages exceed, either singly or when added to winter arrearages, the amount noted in 1204.03 below.\n\nSource. #13986, eff 5-30-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 1200)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1200.html"
